    "long_instructions": "## Investigate with AI\r\n\r\nUse AI Chat to see how its interpretation of data compares to your own.  \r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. **Add the PDF** for the dataset from your station into AI Chat.  \r\n   *(Each dataset represents real sensor or system data from a career scenario — like the Zookeeper or Concert Promoter.)*\r\n\r\n2. **Write your own prompt** to ask the AI what it thinks the data shows.  \r\n   - Try describing what kind of data it is and what you want the AI to look for.  \r\n   - Press **Send** and read the AI’s response.\r\n\r\n3. Compare the AI’s interpretation to your own labels in the **Activity Guide.**  \r\n   - Did the AI describe the data the same way you did?  \r\n   - What details did it notice or miss?\r\n\r\n4. Record your thoughts in the **Investigate with AI** section of your Activity Guide.\r\n\r\n::: details [**Need help with your prompt?**]\r\nTry starting with something like:\r\n> What do you think this data shows?  \r\n> What patterns or problems do you notice in this dataset?  \r\n> Could any of these readings or messages mean something different?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n**Try it out!**\r\n",
